 r←i ListIssues_CollectData_Verbose list;ind
⍝ ⍺ carries index variables for "list"
 r←↑list.(number title labels user.login created_at comments assignees)
 r[;i.labels]←{0=≢⍵:⍵ ⋄ ⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/⍵.name}¨r[;i.labels]         ⍝ Convert lables
⍝r[⍸(⊂' null ')∘≡¨⍕¨r[;i.created_at];i.created_at]←⊂''          ⍝ Convert NULL to ''   ⍝ That should never come as null?!
 r[;i.created_at]←{⍵[(⍳10)]}¨r[;i.created_at]                   ⍝ Convert the date to YYYY-MM-DD
 r[;i.assignees]←{0=≢⍵:⍵ ⋄ 1=≢⍵:⊃⍵ ⋄ ⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/⍵}¨{2::'' ⋄ ⍵.login}¨r[;i.assignees]
 r[⍸r[;i.comments]=0;i.comments]←⊂''                            ⍝ Replace 0 by ''
 r←({⍵,[0.5]'-'⍴⍨¨≢¨⍵}'No.' 'Title' 'Label(s)' 'Creator' 'Created at' '≢⍝' 'Assignees')⍪r
⍝Done
